/* 紧急安全指引（Figma 671:3171）：宋体大标题 + 风险提示、两组编号步骤、重要边界；底部行动区固定。 */
.emergency-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  /* 给固定的底部行动区留出空间：两个按钮 + 间距 + 上下内边距 */
  padding-bottom: calc(320rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.emergency-head {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

/* UIproduct3/Greeting：宋体 30/40，字距 1 */
.emergency-title {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif);
  font-size: 60rpx;
  line-height: 80rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 2rpx;
}

.emergency-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.emergency-section__head {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  padding-bottom: 8rpx;
}

/* 底部行动区：米纸底、上方细线，固定在屏幕底部 */
.safety-action-dock {
  position: fixed;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  z-index: 8;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 32rpx 40rpx calc(32rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  border-top: 2rpx solid var(--p3-hairline);
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}
